| Route | Access | Back / exit | Mobile |
|---|---|---|---|
| `/business/settings/integrations/line` | `ROLE_BUSINESS` 且已完成 business setup | `/business/settings`；workspace sidebar / settings navigation | Family 4 focused header，返回設定總覽 |
