## 28. Test strategy

- Routing：三個 canonical route、legacy merchant alias、auth guard、business guard、setup guard、forced-password guard、returnTo safe handling。
- Normalization：merchant existing connected/disconnected/malformed source immutability；新增 account-link/list malformed response coverage。
- Merchant：save、disable、rotate、test、Rich Menu、pending lock、authoritative reload、stale refresh failure。
- Account-link：missing request、CREATED、AWAITING_LINE、COMPLETED、FAILED、EXPIRED、LINE Login required、confirm handoff。
- Account management：empty、linked list、unlink confirmation、unlink failure、reload failure、multi-business list。
- Accessibility：heading、status text、live states、dialog roles、Escape、focus restoration、keyboard action。
- Security：no plaintext token/secret rendering、request query cleanup、safe return navigation、no raw exception leakage。
- Regression：Family 4 settings overview/navigation/focused shell；Family 5 notification pages；`/profile`；reservation flows；`/force-change-password`；Navbar；notification list。

